{
  "description": "storage: the account-wide store enumeration endpoint (GET /v1/storage/stores -> {stores: [...]}) is absent from the OpenAPI document (live-verified 2026-08-13). Needed by the BlobStore provider's `list` and read-without-state recovery paths (Vercel stores have no tags; ownership is deterministic naming + state, so finding a store by name requires enumeration).",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1storage~1stores",
      "value": {
        "get": {
          "description": "List every storage store (all types: blob, edge-config, ...) on the account or team.",
